        "x1": 0.659490756302521,
        "y1": 0.8041864608076009
      },
      "text": "Moreover, d is uniquely determined by these two properties up to constants. Proof. Deﬁne d|Osm",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
